# Deny everything by default, only allow the SymFM project through.
# This repo's root ended up being the home directory instead of a
# dedicated project folder - this file is a guardrail so a future
# `git add -A`/`git add .` from ~ can't accidentally stage or push
# unrelated home-directory contents (SSH keys, credentials, etc.) to
# this repo's public GitHub remote.
/*
!/Desktop/
/Desktop/*
!/Desktop/SymFM/
